1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,080
No amount of regret rewrites yesterday.

2
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:05,240
No amount of worry controls tomorrow.

3
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:08,600
No guilt can undo what's already happened.

4
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:11,900
No overthinking has ever brought peace.

5
00:00:13,460 --> 00:00:15,660
The only moment you can shape is this one.

6
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:17,840
Live it with intention.

7
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:19,880
Make it beautiful.
